The dish looks like a small paper plate, probably 18-20 cm across and about 230 px wide in the image. The almonds cover roughly 180 px, or about 14-15 cm, as a single heaped layer.

I'd count about 45-50 almonds. At roughly 1.2 g each, that is about 55-60 g. Almonds run about 5.8 kcal/g, so 58 g comes to roughly 335 kcal.

